{"overview":"یوسوکه نوگی از بخش توسعه انرژی ریووش ادعا کرد که ده برابر پیش‌پرداخت رسمی به اشتباه به شرکت زیرساختی محلی GFL در جمهوری بالکان آسیای مرکزی، که در حال ساخت یک نیروگاه خورشیدی بود، واریز شد. مشکوک به دخالت، او به جمهوری بالکان می‌رود تا اختلاف ۹۰ میلیون دلار را جمع‌آوری کند. با همکاری دوست سیا‌اش سام، نوگی اطلاعاتی به دست آورد که تروریست ال‑زائیر کل مبلغ قرارداد را به الماس تبدیل کرده و خارج کرده بود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Yusuke Nogi of Ryosho's Energy Development Division said that 10 times the official down payment was mistakenly sent to GFL, a local infrastructure company involved in a solar energy plant to be built in the Balkan Republic in Central Asia. Suspected of involvement, he heads to the Balkan Republic to collect the difference of $90 million. With the cooperation of his CIA friend Sam, Nogi obtained information that the terrorist al-Zaer had laundered the full amount of the contract money into diamonds and brought it out.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":10,"y":2023,"poster":"/wmiAYztC5VxzQAajK1I59Cxxr6o.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":10,"y":2023,"poster":"/cM69OY6EAX4kGR2wAlQOnFqbtge.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":14,"y":2026,"poster":"/5SSQE1FFnefWcf2TYMuAy5A43wS.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":1,"y":null,"poster":""}],"episodes":25,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"堺雅人","role":"Yusuke Nogi","photo":"/qWylwebPgcOOM3pWHBesGU1MLGZ.jpg","en":"Masato Sakai"},{"name":"هیروشی آبه","role":"Mamoru Nozaki","photo":"/lJODJCQHCUxLqZzqr3iBlTKO8Nx.jpg","en":"Hiroshi Abe"},{"name":"二階堂ふみ","role":"Kaoru Yuzuki","photo":"/tqxgrZdOpx2FuTJYlhago4fttI3.jpg","en":"Fumi Nikaido"},{"name":"توری ماتسوزاکا","role":"Shun Kurosu","photo":"/8JcMm3al3gySuay2EiW3CI19Apj.jpg","en":"Tori Matsuzaka"},{"name":"二宮和也","role":"Nokor","photo":"/4mxogZeEPZiVrnJ4L8ICvOJONfs.jpg","en":"Kazunari Ninomiya"},{"name":"竜星涼","role":"Kotaro Shinjo","photo":"/oh9dwlv987XP3ChY9DtDc9pp